  "body": "Stacked on #2027 (merge #2027 first)\n\n## What changed\n\n- `painted::caption` reads `pal.font_caption` instead of `MIN_LABEL_PX`.\n- `painted::caption` clamps `pal.font_caption` with `clamp::range(..., clamp::FONT)` (`6.0..=32.0` px; non-finite values clamp to `6.0`).\n- `Tokens::DARK.font_caption` and `Tokens::LIGHT.font_caption` change from `12.5` to `10.0` so captions fit inside `ribbon_caption_row_h` (`18.0` px) and stay smaller than `font_label` (`11.0` px).\n- `ribbon_rows` tests track `t.font_caption` and pin the token, the clamp window, and built-in theme fit.\n- Added `docs/decisions/2063-font-caption.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nCommit `33cd8b56` raised `Tokens::font_caption` to `12.5` when it removed `painted::caption`. Commit `e5fcf588` restored `painted::caption` with `FontId::proportional(MIN_LABEL_PX)` (`10.0`). Later work lowered `font_label` to `11.0`, leaving `font_caption` unused at `12.5`.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins (`ribbon_rows`): `caption_uses_font_caption_token`, `caption_clamps_out_of_range_font_caption`, `builtin_caption_font_fits_caption_row`, and updated `tab_text_and_caption_text_fit_their_rows_in_each_theme` failed on unchanged code (`10.0 != 16.0`, `10.0 != 6.0`, `12.5 px` overflowed `18 px`) and passed after the fix (`8 passed; 0 failed`).\n- Mutation checks:\n  1. Reverted `painted.rs` to `#2027` (`MIN_LABEL_PX`): `caption_uses_font_caption_token` and `caption_clamps_out_of_range_font_caption` failed. Restored `painted.rs`: passed.\n  2. Removed `clamp::range` in `painted.rs` (raw `pal.font_caption`): `caption_clamps_out_of_range_font_caption` failed. Restored `clamp::range`: passed.\n  3. Reverted `tables.rs` to `#2027` (`12.5`): `builtin_caption_font_fits_caption_row` and `tab_text_and_caption_text_fit_their_rows_in_each_theme` failed. Restored `10.0`: passed.\n- Structural check: `ribbon_labels_whole_and_captions_painted` passed (`1 passed; 0 failed`).\n- Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (`ui suites`: `--lib` `832 passed, 6 ignored`, `boundary` `3 passed`, `boundary_picks` `6 passed`, `sinker_setup` `2 passed`, `theme_files` `14 passed`, `waterjet_tool` `1 passed`).\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with zero warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Full workspace `cargo xtask gate` outside `camcraft-ui`.\n- `#[ignore]` visual snapshot tests (6 ignored in `--lib`).\n- Interactive live window rendering with a custom `\"font_caption\"` JSON theme file (`painted::caption` runs headless via `egui_kittest::Harness`).\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- PR #2027 (stacked on #2027; merge #2027 first): touches `painted::caption` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/painted.rs`, `Tokens::DARK` and `Tokens::LIGHT` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/tables.rs`, and `tab_text_and_caption_text_fit_their_rows_in_each_theme` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ribbon_rows.rs`.\n- PR #2038 (stacked on #2027): touches `assets/themes/theme.json.example` (currently `\"font_caption\": 12.5`) and `crates/ui/tests/theme_example.rs` (`assert_eq!(theme.tokens, Tokens::DARK)`). Whichever merges second updates `\"font_caption\": 10.0` in `theme.json.example`.\n\nChangelog: Read `Tokens::font_caption` for ribbon group captions and align built-in theme defaults to `10.0` px.\nFixes #2063\n\n## Review evidence\n\nThese images show the ribbon in both shipped theme files.\nThe capture uses the shipping shell layout in an egui test harness at 1280 × 720 pixels.\nThe viewport is the test harness placeholder. The ribbon uses the shipping paint code.\n\nBefore: `739b7ce5` (the parent of the caption fix).\nAfter: `b6f0fac962a42cf26dce2cab7555c21d1826cf6e`.\n\nBoth shipped themes paint 10 px captions before and after this fix.\nTheir appearance stays the same. Custom caption values change through the theme token.\nThe existing structural tests check those values and the clamp limits.\n\n| Theme | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Teal Night | ![teal-night-before.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/433f26fa09a0351bde937f09ef3fbb6e4547131d/2086/teal-night-before.png) | ![teal-night-after.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/433f26fa09a0351bde937f09ef3fbb6e4547131d/2086/teal-night-after.png) |\n| Horizon Day | ![horizon-day-before.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/433f26fa09a0351bde937f09ef3fbb6e4547131d/2086/horizon-day-before.png) | ![horizon-day-after.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/433f26fa09a0351bde937f09ef3fbb6e4547131d/2086/horizon-day-after.png) |\n\nImage commit: `433f26fa09a0351bde937f09ef3fbb6e4547131d` on the fork’s `pr-screenshots` branch.\nThe evidence record is commit `2af301b88c5193691b1fab737ddfdb4ce9126700`. It has the same source tree as the after capture.\n",
